<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA BEAT ZIMBABWE BY FOUR WICKETS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA BEAT ZIMBABWE BY FOUR WICKETS.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa beat Zimbabwe by four wickets in the triangular series day-night match at the Wanderers on Friday.</p>
<p>Scores: Zimbabwe 256-8 (50 overs), South Africa 259-6 (48.3).</p>
</text>
